- [x] T007 [US2] Update createRoom to trim names and avoid fallback to default "Player" when custom name is specified in backend/src/services/roomStore.ts
- [x] T008 [US2] Add unit test for createRoom custom name validation and propagation in backend/src/services/roomStore.test.ts

**Checkpoint**: At this point, User Stories 1 AND 2 should both work independently

